meta {
  name: Post places within (polygon)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/places/within
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "geometry": {
      "type": "Polygon",
      "coordinates": [
        [
          [2.15, 41.37],
          [2.15, 41.40],
          [2.19, 41.40],
          [2.19, 41.37],
          [2.15, 41.37]
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Counts Overture Places (POIs) inside an arbitrary GeoJSON polygon — e.g. one
  contour Feature's `geometry` plucked directly from an `/isochrone` response,
  instead of re-looking it up by point/mode/minutes.

  Body (polygon mode):
  - `geometry` object, required — GeoJSON `Polygon` or `MultiPolygon`

  Polygon's bbox must fall within the Catalonia bounding box or the request 400s.

  See "Post places within (lookup)" for response shape and error codes — identical
  for both input modes.
}
